      "outcomes": [
        {
          "id": "errand-paid-and-second",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{shopkeeper}掂了掂空筐，把二十赫勒放在{subject}手里，又说客栈后面还有一包糖。{subject}抱着糖包走过电车轨道时，鞋底被烫热的铁轨硌了一下，回来时口袋里有四十赫勒。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "cash",
              "householdId": "$household",
              "amount": 40,
              "reason": "跑两趟腿的工钱"
            },
            {
              "type": "skill",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "skill": "social",
              "amount": 0.03,
              "reason": "学着和客栈伙计打交道"
            },
            {
              "type": "mood",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": 0.02,
              "reason": "挣到第一笔钱"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "errand-paid-and-second",
              "text": "硬币在裤袋里碰出声响，{subject}回家路上数了两遍，还是把四十赫勒塞进厨房的陶罐。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "alt",
              "key": "errand-paid-and-second",
              "text": "{shopkeeper}在账簿上画了一道，头也没抬，{subject}盯着自己的手指，觉得比出门时稳当些。",
              "tone": [
                "matter-of-fact"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "errand-pressed-bread-half-pay",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "电车轮子擦过街心时{subject}急着跳开，筐里的面包压扁了一角。{shopkeeper}翻检了两遍，扣下十赫勒，只给十赫勒，还说下次要看路。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "cash",
              "householdId": "$household",
              "amount": 10,
              "reason": "面包压坏扣了一半工钱"
            },
            {
              "type": "mood",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": -0.03,
              "reason": "被扣工钱"
            },
            {
              "type": "skill",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "skill": "craft",
              "amount": 0.02,
              "reason": "见识了送货的路数"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "errand-pressed-bread-half-pay",
              "text": "扁掉的那只面包被{shopkeeper}用两个指头拈起来，{subject}想说什么，却只看见老板娘在柜台后面摇了摇头。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "alt",
              "key": "errand-pressed-bread-half-pay",
              "text": "电车铃铛响得人心里发紧，{subject}退到人行道上，筐子一歪，纸包里就软塌下去一块。",
              "tone": [
                "matter-of-fact"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "errand-refuse-go-docks",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}摇头说这不算正经活，{shopkeeper}把二十赫勒收回围裙口袋。{subject}绕到码头上问搬运工，{worker}从肩上放下麻袋，说这儿的活要等明天早上工头来挑人。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "flag",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "flag": "seeking_work",
              "add": true,
              "reason": "去码头打听正经工作"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$worker",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": 0.03,
              "affection": 0,
              "obligation": 0,
              "fear": 0,
              "respect": 0.02,
              "reason": "在码头问过工"
            },
            {
              "type": "mood",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": -0.01,
              "reason": "空手而归"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "errand-refuse-go-docks",
              "text": "码头上麻袋蹭着石阶发出沙沙声，{worker}说话时并没停下抹脖子上的汗，{subject}站在一摊水渍边上等他说完。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "alt",
              "key": "errand-refuse-go-docks",
              "text": "杂货铺里的面包味跟着{subject}走了一段路才散，{subject}低头看自己比{shopkeeper}还长的胳膊，往码头去了。",
              "tone": [
                "matter-of-fact"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p9-childhood-adolescence.church-club",
